    <section><h2>Apon Team & Mentors</h2><p>Our passionate and dedicated global team brings together a diverse range of skills and expertise to deliver exceptional results. From creative visionaries to meticulous strategists, we work seamlessly together to meet and exceed our clients’ expectations.</p><h3>Monir Bhuiyan PhD</h3><p>Dr. Moniruzzaman Bhuiyan, founder of Apon.uk, is an IT expert and researcher, Lead Software Architect, for Corporate and Investment Banking of a leading British Bank. He is a founder of Global NRB organization, based in USA. He is also founder multiple projects, groups and initiatives in Bangladesh and worldwide. He leads organization, teams, innovation, software solution architecture, design, tech transformation and Fintech regulatory requirement. He has 25+ years of experience with the sector globally.</p><p>He has achieved PhD degree from University of Wales, UK under UK govt. scholarship and Post-doctoral fellowship from University of Northumbria, UK. He is an ex faculty of IIT, Dhaka University, also worked for two UK universities before moving to Fintech R&D. He started his career as technology reporter and writer in 1996 and in 1999, started software engineering role for a Amsterdam based Fintech.</p><p>Dr. Bhuiyan’s specializations are in future technology, AI, global education and career, counselling, software & data architecture, Cloud, FinTech. He worked as consultant, expert and researcher for Bangladesh Bank, JAICA, Internet Society, Dutch and international companies.</p><p>He is a public speaker, an author/editor of many popular technology articles, peer reviewed publications and books; has regularly contributed for national dailies and magazines since 1996. He is a Microsoft Certified Professional (MCP) and PRINCE2 practitioner. He is a professional member of British Computer Society. He is also involved in voluntary Athletics coaching with England Athletics, loves cycling and boating.</p></section>
